<<Reset>>
<<Scene #000000 0.985>>

<<Act Brigada brigadaAngry 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: ZORAN! I have been marching for TWO DAYS through YOUR miserable countryside!

<<Act Zoran zoranChill 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Ah, Brigada. Still alive, I see. The roads are... treacherous this time of year.
<<Act Brigada brigadaTalk 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: Treacherous?! The roads are FINE! It's your TROOPS that keep attacking my supply lines!
<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: My troops? Preposterous. Probably just bandits hehe.

<<Act Brigada brigadaAngryRat 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: And ANOTHER thing! You left your FILTHY RAT NURSERY with me, Zoran!
Brigada: Do you know what it's like to wake up to seventeen hundred rats looking at you in the middle of the night?!
<<Act Brigada brigadaAngry 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: They BREED, Zoran. Constantly! I can't sleep! There's always more rats!
<<Act Zoran zoranTalk 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Ah yes, my most prized breeding program. You're taking good care of Gertrude's descendants?
<<Act Brigada brigadaAngryRat 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: NO! They are NOT doing well! They've formed a UNION!
<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Ha! Give them a tiny running wheel, they'll negotiate for a bigger one.
Zoran: They grow up so fast~ <br>Just like papa taught them.

<<Act Brigada brigadaAngry 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: Even in your absence you find a way to terrorize me...
Brigada: while you're off... off... doing WHAT exactly?!

<<LookAt 1 7>>
<<Scene #000000 0.585>>
<<Act Zoran zoranSurprise 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: ...
<<Act Zoran zoranTalk 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: On a diplomatic mission... Advising. On... matters of state.
<<Scene #000000 0.985>>
<<Act Brigada brigadaChill 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: Advising WHO?

<<Act Wizard wizardChill 0.75 0.2 #61eb45>>
Wizard: The Princess, actually. She's standing right here.
<<Act Zoran zoranSurprise 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: WHYYY would you say that?!
<<Act Wizard wizardChill 0.75 0.2 #61eb45>>
Wizard: You asked me to always announce guests properly. I'm doing helpful!
<<Hide Wizard>>

<<Act Brigada brigadaAngry 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: ...
Brigada: A PRINCESS?!
<<Act Brigada brigadaTalk 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: Zoran, you're "advising" a PRINCESS?
<<Act Zoran zoranTalk 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: It's purely professional! She needed help with...
<<Act Zoran zoranSurprise 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: ...learning third grade math? Very boring. You wouldn't be interested.

<<LookAt 1 7>>
<<Act Brigada brigadaTalk 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: Let me see her.
<<Act Zoran zoranSurprise 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: NO! She's... Hideously scarred. It would upset you.
<<Act Brigada brigadaAngry 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: Show me the harlot! NOW!
<<Act Zoran zoranChill 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>

<<Act Wizard wizardChill 0.75 0.2 #61eb45>>
Wizard: I can adjust the mirror's view angle! One moment...
<<Act Zoran zoranSurprise 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Don't you dare, you geriatric midget!
<<Hide Wizard>>

<<Draw mirror 0.75 0.35>>
<<LookAt 1 4>>
Brigada: ...
Brigada: THAT'S her?
<<Act Brigada brigadaChill 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: She's... so YOUNG.
<<Act Zoran zoranTalk 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: She's older than she looks! Very old. Ancient, even. Practically a crone.

<<Act Brigada brigadaTalk 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: And she doesn't say anything... What's wrong? Cat got your tongue, little princess?
Zoran: She's stoic. A warrior's disposition. Very intimidating.
<<Act Brigada brigadaChill 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: Or maybe she's just SIMPLE.
<<Act Zoran zoranSurprise 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: How dare you! She can read and everything! (I think...)

<<Act Wizard wizardChill 0.75 0.2 #61eb45>>
Wizard: Actually, I've noticed she never speaks. It's been quite peaceful since the king passed.
<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: See? The wizard appreciates her. We've bonded.

<<Act Brigada brigadaTalk 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: That's it! I'm doubling my march speed! I'll be at your gates within the week!
<<Act Zoran zoranChill 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: The gates are very sturdy. Take your time. Maybe stop for a picnic.
<<Act Brigada brigadaAngry 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: And when I get there, I'm going to have a nice LONG chat with your little CRONE about what happens to women who steal other women's HUSBANDS!

<<Scene #000000 0.585>>
<<Act Zoran zoranSurprise 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Your Majesty, we need to slow her advance. NOW.
